== first-step logit fidelity vs DENSE (n=5 prompts, ctx=3500, preset=mid, quant=nf4) ==
             arm  top1 agree  KL(dense||arm)  dense-top1 rank  top5 overlap   blocks
      dense_true       5/5           0.00000             0.00          5.0/5        0
  dense_true/dec       5/5           0.00000             0.00          5.0/5        0
        baseline       5/5           0.00554             0.00          4.6/5        0
    baseline/dec       5/5           0.00068             0.00          5.0/5        0
